le,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Your songs are like a breath of fresh air in winter."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "But don't worry, I'll stay your fan,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Even if sometimes, I take a little break, simply."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}